Package: papyrus
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Papyrus Maintainers <maintainers@papyrus.example>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34)
Homepage: https://github.com/papyrus/papyrus
Description: Project-level backlog and documentation manager
 Papyrus is a command-line tool for managing a project's backlog and
 long-term documentation from a single interface. It combines task,
 milestone, release, and decision tracking with requirements, glossary,
 UI and technical specifications, audit records, and business rules.
